    {
      "title": "代換",
      "prompt": "求 $\\sin(x^2)$ 的 Maclaurin 級數中 $x^6$ 與 $x^{10}$ 的係數。",
      "problemId": "rel-hard-ser-004",
      "steps": [
        "$\\sin u=u-\\frac{u^3}{3!}+\\frac{u^5}{5!}-\\cdots$，$u=x^2$。",
        "$\\sin(x^2)=x^2-\\frac{x^6}{6}+\\frac{x^{10}}{120}-\\cdots$。",
        "$x^6$ 的係數 $-\\frac{1}{6}$，$x^{10}$ 的係數 $\\frac{1}{120}$。（$x^8$ 的係數是 0：只有 $4k+2$ 次方的項。）"
      ],
      "answer": "$-\\frac{1}{6}$ 與 $\\frac{1}{120}$",
      "claim": "LIM((sin(x^2)-x^2)/x^6, 0) == -1/6 ;; LIM((sin(x^2) - x^2 + x^6/6)/x^10, 0) == 1/120"
    },
    {
      "title": "兩個級數相乘",
      "prompt": "求 $e^x\\ln(1+x)$ 的 $x^3$ 係數。",
      "problemId": "depth-ser-015",
      "steps": [
        "$e^x=1+x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\cdots$，$\\ln(1+x)=x-\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{3}-\\cdots$。",
        "收集次方和為 3 的乘積：$1\\cdot\\frac{x^3}{3}+x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)+\\frac{x^2}{2}\\cdot x$。",
        "係數 $=\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{3}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{3}$",
      "claim": "LIM((e^x*ln(1+x) - x - x^2/2)/x^3, 0) == 1/3"
    },
    {
      "title": "認出是哪個級數",
      "prompt": "求 $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^n\\pi^{2n+1}}{6^{2n+1}(2n+1)!}$。",
      "problemId": "lec-15-q3c",
      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{\\pi^{2n+1}}{6^{2n+1}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)^{2n+1}$，所以這是 $\\sum \\frac{(-1)^n(\\pi/6)^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!}$。",
        "正是 $\\sin x$ 的級數在 $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ 的值。",
        "和 $=\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\frac{1}{2}$。（只取到 $x^7$ 項：$\\frac{\\pi}{6}-\\frac{(\\pi/6)^3}{6}+\\frac{(\\pi/6)^5}{120}-\\frac{(\\pi/6)^7}{5040}\\approx 0.5000000$，已經非常準。）"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "claim": "SUB(x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040, pi/6) == 0.5"
    }
